# Patterns to ignore when building Helm chart packages.
# Shell glob matching, relative path matching, and negation (prefixed with !).
# One pattern per line.
#
# ⚠️ Deliberately MINIMAL. This chart had no .helmignore until #1597, so every
# pattern added here CHANGES what ships in tenant-api-<version>.tgz. It has no
# pattern now: the one file it excluded (a lint variant for the RBAC scope
# switches) went away with the switches (ADR-027 §7). Do not extend it with
# the usual boilerplate (README.md, .git, *.swp …) without checking what that
# would remove from the published artifact.
#
# NB: Helm's .helmignore matcher does NOT support `**` (it errors and aborts
# `helm template` / `helm install`). A bare basename already matches at any
# depth. (Same constraint documented in helm/da-portal/.helmignore.)

# #1018: the Pod Security gate's value sets (tests/pss). They are inputs to
# that test, not deployment profiles, and must not ship in the .tgz
# (check_chart_package_contents.py DECLARED_SUBTREES lists templates only).
# helm template/-f reads them from the source tree regardless of this line.
ci/
